<title>USA: NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-CONFERENCE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-CONFERENCE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of National Football League conference championship games on Sunday:</p>
<p>	 National Football Conference (NFC)</p>
<p> Green Bay Packers     30   Carolina Panthers	13</p>
<p>	 American Football Conference (AFC)</p>
<p> New England Patriots  20   Jacksonville Jaguars    6</p>
<p>Note: Packers will meet Patriots in Super Bowl XXXI on January 26 in New Orleans.</p>
</text>
